    "exact_append": "\nA separate [annual company property tax workpaper](bf-company-property-tax.md) adds the ordinary TFS job under CGI arts. 251–257 and the signed 2026 art. 772 penalty overlay. Its [writer ledger](../../evidence/ledgers/burkina-faso-property-20261101/bf-company-property-tax.md) is pending independent review. Actual valuation, declaration forms, payment calendar and special exemptions remain held. The ten earlier Guide bodies and all earlier evidence are preserved; all seven domains remain partial.\n",
